  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aid to victims of explosion of the Kakhovska HPP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">On June 6, Russia blew up the Kakhovska HPP. As a result, more than 80 populated villages on the right and left banks of the Dnipro are at risk of complete flooding. The water has already reached Kherson and flooded part of the city. Funds are needed for the purchase of boats, inflatable vests, pumps and other equipment needed for the evacuation of the civilian population, in particular from the occupied Left Bank, where evacuation is not carried out</narrative>
  </description>
